text:
The plate holds a few avocado pieces: one wedge with the skin removed, one slice, and one piece with the skin on. Together they look like roughly half an avocado, about 100 g of flesh. Avocado has about 160 kcal per 100 g, so that comes to about 160 kcal. The skin-on piece adds a little mass, so I estimate about 110 g total, or about 150 kcal.

The second plate on the left is only partly visible, so I left it out.

